      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLUB DOZER (2) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 23.05 beating Rusty Cortez. Fair draw can see a good run and in form and has the ability. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Expected to be right there at the finish again. LITTLE KADE (8) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a one length second (19.25) behind Humble Smiles at Bulli. The form out of her last race has been franked. Expected to be in this for a long way. DELUSIONAL BEV (7) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Nowra over 365m behind Winsome Way (21.10) in a Grade 5. Has ability and can measure up. ALL MINE HONEY (1) warrants respect with the drop in trip.",
